<section class="info-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">Warranty</span><h1>A {{ settings.warranty.years }}-Year Warranty on Every Nestica Product</h1><p>Every set, umbrella and swing from Nestica carries a {{ settings.warranty.years }}-year warranty against manufacturing defects, starting from the delivery date.</p></div></section><section class="container section-space info-page"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="policy-card"><h2>What Is Covered</h2><ul><li>Manufacturing defects in the metal frame and welds.</li><li>Paint peeling or rust caused by a manufacturing or treatment defect.</li><li>Joints loosening or weakening under normal use.</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="policy-card"><h2>What Is Not Covered</h2><ul><li>Misuse, or loads above the capacity stated in the product specifications.</li><li>Breakage or damage from accidents or moving the product after delivery.</li><li>Normal wear of fabric and cushions, such as color fading in the sun.</li><li>Any modification or third-party repair before Nestica reviews the case.</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="policy-card"><h2>If a Problem Appears</h2><ul><li>Contact us on WhatsApp as soon as you notice the issue.</li><li>Send your order number with clear photos and video.</li><li>Our team reviews the case, and if the defect is covered we repair or replace the part.</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="policy-card"><h2>Keep These</h2><ul><li>Your WhatsApp order confirmation.</li><li>The invoice or proof of your {{ settings.payment.depositPercent }}% deposit.</li><li>The care instructions on the <a href="{{ '/en/materials/' | url }}">Materials and Care</a> page.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="container info-alert"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><div><h2>Custom Orders Have the Same Warranty</h2><p>If you order a different size or color, the same warranty applies. Any additional terms are written in your order confirmation.</p></div></section>
